Read a framebuffer update
  Apply each supported pixel rectangle in order, within the framebuffer and paint limits.
  End at the advertised count or at LastRect, whichever comes first.
  If DesktopSize appears, retain overlapping pixels and accept only LastRect after it.
  After a resize, keep the displayed frame and request a full frame at the new size.
  Publish a completed frame with pixels and request an incremental update.
